  "reason": "No experiments are completed yet, so the main uncertainty is the baseline performance of a simple, low-confounding model. config_001 tests a minimal RNA-only, single-profile PCA baseline with no aggregation or fusion, establishing a reference for RNA representation quality and for later comparisons to multiprofile, learned RNA encoders, image-only, and multimodal settings. It is the best first use of budget because it is simple, interpretable, and isolates the core RNA signal before adding complexity."
